put.description:
Update the flow JSON definition.

Uploads the flow JSON to Meta's API as a multipart file upload.
Only DRAFT flows can have their JSON updated.

**Flow JSON Structure:**
```json
{
  "version": "5.0",
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "SCREEN_ID",
      "title": "Screen Title",
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [...]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

InforUVerifyRequest.description:
POST /inforumobile/verify — validate credentials without creating an
instance (connect-modal 'test credentials'). Used for ONE InforU call;
never logged or persisted (connect is where they get encrypted at rest).
